# markdown: private by default — GRANT.md, notes and drafts stay local.
#
# Public docs must be allow-listed explicitly. The default-deny is deliberate,
# but it fails silently: a doc added here is simply never committed, and the
# first sign of trouble is someone following a link to a file that was never
# published. Add the filename below when a doc is meant to be public.
*.md
!README.md
!SCHEMA.md

# secrets — the OpenAI key for brief.js lives here and must never be published
.env

# misc
*.bak
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
